{
  "id": "final-reflection",
  "kind": "ending",
  "label": "Final Reflection",
  "title": "FINAL REFLECTION",
  "shortTitle": "Final Reflection",
  "file": "chapters/21-final-reflection.json",
  "index": 21,
  "sourceRange": [
    901,
    915
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At some point in life, every child will feel misunderstood. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 902
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And every parent will feel unappreciated. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 903
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But most people never realize — both are happening at the same time, inside "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 904
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the same home. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 905
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We keep waiting for the other side to understand first… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 906
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and in that waiting, years quietly pass. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 907
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Maybe understanding was never about agreeing. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 908
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Maybe it was always about seeing the other person without reducing them to "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 909
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "their reaction. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 910
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if you ever look back and feel “they never understood me” or “I was never "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 911
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "understood” — "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 912
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "pause and ask one thing: "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 913
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Did I ever try to understand before expecting to be understood?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 914
    }
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 901
  },
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
